1
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:13,800
(Let it go.)

2
00:00:43,724 --> 00:00:45,964
=Revenge From A Wife=

3
00:00:46,091 --> 00:00:48,317
=Episode 26=

4
00:00:56,600 --> 00:00:57,479
Eunuch Li.

5
00:00:58,159 --> 00:01:00,679
His Majesty finally remembered me.

6
00:01:00,799 --> 00:01:01,799
Sorry for the wait, General.

7
00:01:02,159 --> 00:01:02,880
His Majesty

8
00:01:03,159 --> 00:01:04,200
will see you now.

9
00:01:05,719 --> 00:01:06,799
I've brought His Majesty

10
00:01:06,799 --> 00:01:08,840
several chests of spoils from battle.

11
00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:10,519
They're all fine treasures.

12
00:01:11,040 --> 00:01:12,079
You know His Majesty's tastes

13
00:01:12,079 --> 00:01:13,239
better than anyone.

14
00:01:13,680 --> 00:01:14,680
Just tell me straight.

15
00:01:14,920 --> 00:01:16,680
What does His Majesty favor these days?

16
00:01:16,879 --> 00:01:18,840
Save me the trouble of guessing

17
00:01:19,319 --> 00:01:20,120
and wasting my time.

18
00:01:21,439 --> 00:01:22,439
Lately, His Majesty

19
00:01:23,159 --> 00:01:25,159
has lost interest in

20
00:01:25,159 --> 00:01:26,359
gold, jade, and luxuries.

21
00:01:27,200 --> 00:01:29,640
Weapons, however,

22
00:01:30,200 --> 00:01:31,239
have caught his interest.

23
00:01:31,760 --> 00:01:33,400
Just days ago, he said

24
00:01:33,879 --> 00:01:35,120
the true treasures are blades

25
00:01:35,359 --> 00:01:38,079
that have drawn blood in battle.

26
00:01:38,640 --> 00:01:39,439
Weapons?

27
00:01:41,159 --> 00:01:42,319
You should've said so!

28
00:01:51,200 --> 00:01:52,599
This Nine-Star Sword

29
00:01:52,799 --> 00:01:55,000
was seized when we destroyed
the Hu royal court last month.

30
00:01:55,439 --> 00:01:57,640
I tested the blade myself.

31
00:01:57,640 --> 00:01:58,719
It cuts iron with ease.

32
00:02:01,879 --> 00:02:02,480
That's the one.

33
00:02:03,359 --> 00:02:04,959
His Majesty likes weapons.

34
00:02:05,439 --> 00:02:07,680
I'll present it to him myself

35
00:02:08,159 --> 00:02:10,519
and tell him how I fought
battle after battle

36
00:02:10,519 --> 00:02:12,120
to secure the northern frontier.

37
00:02:14,599 --> 00:02:15,599
A wise choice, General.

38
00:02:16,039 --> 00:02:17,000
His Majesty

39
00:02:17,360 --> 00:02:18,439
will surely be pleased.

40
00:02:19,120 --> 00:02:19,680
Good.

41
00:02:20,599 --> 00:02:22,280
Then, if you please,

42
00:02:22,840 --> 00:02:25,159
help me out of my armor and get changed.

43
00:02:25,520 --> 00:02:26,159
Wait.

44
00:02:26,639 --> 00:02:27,639
If you present the sword,

45
00:02:27,879 --> 00:02:30,840
you should wear the armor with it.

46
00:02:31,080 --> 00:02:33,479
His Majesty keeps talking about

47
00:02:33,479 --> 00:02:35,240
the victory at the northern frontier.

48
00:02:36,199 --> 00:02:37,800
Wear your armor into the hall

49
00:02:38,039 --> 00:02:40,360
and let His Majesty see

50
00:02:40,919 --> 00:02:44,199
a hero of Daxia in all his glory.

51
00:02:46,080 --> 00:02:46,840
Good point.

52
00:02:47,439 --> 00:02:47,879
Let's go.

53
00:02:48,520 --> 00:02:49,039
This way.

54
00:02:51,439 --> 00:02:55,680
Summon General Zhang Heng.

55
00:02:59,120 --> 00:03:01,759
Your Majesty. I, Zhang Heng,
pay my respects.

56
00:03:02,319 --> 00:03:03,919
After our great victory
at the northern frontier,

57
00:03:04,520 --> 00:03:06,719
we seized this Nine-Star Sword
from the Hu.

58
00:03:07,159 --> 00:03:08,680
I hereby present it to Your Majesty.

59
00:03:09,599 --> 00:03:10,159
Protect His Majesty!

60
00:03:10,560 --> 00:03:11,479
Protect His Majesty!

61
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:20,120
General Zhang, you entered my hall
in full armor, sword in hand.

62
00:03:20,439 --> 00:03:21,759
Quite the show of force.

63
00:03:22,960 --> 00:03:23,560
Your Majesty.

64
00:03:24,039 --> 00:03:24,879
I'm innocent!

65
00:03:25,599 --> 00:03:26,520
It was Li Dehai.

66
00:03:26,960 --> 00:03:28,879
He said you've been into weapons lately,

67
00:03:28,879 --> 00:03:29,599
so I...

68
00:03:31,759 --> 00:03:32,400
Your Majesty.

69
00:03:33,639 --> 00:03:35,159
You laid a trap for me!

70
00:03:37,199 --> 00:03:37,919
A trap?

71
00:03:38,400 --> 00:03:40,319
You chose the sword yourself.

72
00:03:40,319 --> 00:03:42,039
You put on the armor yourself.

73
00:03:42,639 --> 00:03:45,360
You barged into this hall yourself.

74
00:03:45,879 --> 00:03:47,479
So tell me,

75
00:03:48,319 --> 00:03:49,840
who laid this trap for you?

76
00:03:50,199 --> 00:03:51,199
Who dares touch me?

77
00:03:51,800 --> 00:03:53,120
The 300,000 troops
at the northern frontier

78
00:03:53,360 --> 00:03:54,719
are waiting for my return.

79
00:03:54,919 --> 00:03:55,520
If anything

80
00:03:55,800 --> 00:03:56,800
happens to me today,

81
00:03:57,240 --> 00:03:58,120
the frontier will descend into chaos.

82
00:04:01,560 --> 00:04:03,560
You don't really think

83
00:04:04,360 --> 00:04:07,680
my soldiers answer only to you, do you?

84
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:09,120
Let me tell you this.

85
00:04:09,639 --> 00:04:13,159
My own guards have taken over
the northern frontier camp.

86
00:04:13,639 --> 00:04:15,599
Your loyalists there

87
00:04:16,199 --> 00:04:18,560
were executed on the spot.

88
00:04:20,439 --> 00:04:21,240
Zhang Heng.

89
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:23,600
Have you forgotten?

90
00:04:24,120 --> 00:04:25,519
Daxia

91
00:04:26,680 --> 00:04:27,759
belongs to House Xiao.

92
00:04:28,319 --> 00:04:29,120
Take him away.

93
00:04:31,040 --> 00:04:31,759
Move.

94
00:04:39,800 --> 00:04:40,399
Your Majesty.

95
00:04:40,839 --> 00:04:42,199
My uncle would never try to
assassinate you,

96
00:04:42,560 --> 00:04:43,720
much less rebel.

97
00:04:44,439 --> 00:04:47,000
He's guarded the northern frontier
for you all these years.

98
00:04:47,399 --> 00:04:47,879
Your Majesty.

99
00:04:48,240 --> 00:04:49,399
My uncle has always been loyal.

100
00:04:49,720 --> 00:04:50,720
Please judge him fairly.

101
00:04:51,399 --> 00:04:52,600
Loyal?

102
00:04:52,959 --> 00:04:55,360
He embezzled a million taels
in the Guizhen Cottage case,

103
00:04:55,360 --> 00:04:56,800
and treated lives as worthless.

104
00:04:57,040 --> 00:04:59,519
Then he came armed before me,

105
00:04:59,519 --> 00:05:00,839
intending to assassinate me.

106
00:05:01,680 --> 00:05:02,839
And you call that

107
00:05:03,480 --> 00:05:05,000
loyalty?

108
00:05:05,720 --> 00:05:06,240
Your Majesty.

109
00:05:06,439 --> 00:05:07,680
My uncle must've been framed.

110
00:05:09,279 --> 00:05:10,759
Su Cao. It had to be Su Cao!

111
00:05:10,959 --> 00:05:12,079
She framed my uncle!

112
00:05:12,079 --> 00:05:14,000
Even now, you still try to
implicate others.

113
00:05:19,639 --> 00:05:20,319
Your Majesty.

114
00:05:21,240 --> 00:05:21,920
Your Majesty.

115
00:05:23,560 --> 00:05:24,079
Your Majesty.

116
00:05:24,639 --> 00:05:26,040
You promised my sister

117
00:05:26,439 --> 00:05:27,920
you'd take care of me.

118
00:05:29,199 --> 00:05:29,920
You said

119
00:05:30,399 --> 00:05:32,959
as long as I was by your side,

120
00:05:33,439 --> 00:05:35,000
no one could ever mistreat me.

121
00:05:35,480 --> 00:05:36,120
Your Majesty.

122
00:05:36,759 --> 00:05:39,120
For all the years my sister and I

123
00:05:39,120 --> 00:05:41,480
devoted ourselves to you,

124
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:42,959
please...

125
00:05:44,000 --> 00:05:45,639
take back your decree.

126
00:05:51,560 --> 00:05:52,160
Your Majesty.

127
00:05:52,680 --> 00:05:54,000
I am guilty of deceiving Your Majesty.

128
00:05:54,319 --> 00:05:55,519
Tonight, I dare not hide it any longer.

129
00:05:55,920 --> 00:05:56,879
What is it now?

130
00:05:57,519 --> 00:05:59,959
The late Empress Roujia
didn't die of illness.

131
00:06:00,480 --> 00:06:02,800
Consort Chen killed her.

132
00:06:07,120 --> 00:06:08,079
Tell me everything.

133
00:06:10,399 --> 00:06:12,120
Consort Chen bribed
an imperial physician

134
00:06:12,480 --> 00:06:14,680
to poison the late Empress's medicine

135
00:06:15,120 --> 00:06:16,279
over time, leaving her weak.

136
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:18,399
The night the late Empress died,

137
00:06:18,879 --> 00:06:20,680
Noble Consort Chen went in alone.

138
00:06:21,319 --> 00:06:23,920
I was on duty in the outer room.

139
00:06:25,040 --> 00:06:26,120
I heard her

140
00:06:26,360 --> 00:06:28,879
threaten the young prince's life

141
00:06:29,839 --> 00:06:32,600
and force the late Empress
to drink one last bowl of poison.

142
00:06:33,160 --> 00:06:34,759
Stop lying!

143
00:06:38,879 --> 00:06:41,160
I've spent years gathering this evidence
in secret.

144
00:06:41,560 --> 00:06:42,720
Please examine it, Your Majesty.

145
00:06:48,319 --> 00:06:49,399
My father and brothers

146
00:06:49,920 --> 00:06:51,600
served under Zhang Heng.

147
00:06:52,120 --> 00:06:54,000
They were threatened by
Noble Consort Chen and Zhang Heng,

148
00:06:54,439 --> 00:06:55,879
and dared not speak of many things.

149
00:06:56,720 --> 00:06:58,079
Now that Zhang Heng
has been brought to justice,

150
00:06:58,560 --> 00:07:00,639
I finally dare to tell the truth.

151
00:07:01,079 --> 00:07:03,480
Your Majesty,
please seek justice for Empress Roujia.

152
00:07:04,319 --> 00:07:04,959
Your Majesty.

153
00:07:05,160 --> 00:07:06,000
I didn't do it.

154
00:07:07,079 --> 00:07:07,600
They...

155
00:07:08,439 --> 00:07:09,920
They're framing me.

156
00:07:10,240 --> 00:07:11,879
They're all conspiring to frame me!

157
00:07:12,240 --> 00:07:12,959
Your Majesty.

158
00:07:14,079 --> 00:07:15,680
Your Majesty, you have to believe me!

159
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:18,800
The evidence is conclusive.

160
00:07:18,800 --> 00:07:20,000
And you still deny it?

161
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:21,800
Your Majesty.

162
00:07:22,399 --> 00:07:25,639
Roujia was always thinking of you.

163
00:07:27,160 --> 00:07:28,839
She knelt before me

164
00:07:28,839 --> 00:07:30,959
to secure your uncle a military post.

165
00:07:31,279 --> 00:07:32,519
She prepared your dowry

166
00:07:32,720 --> 00:07:33,839
and found you a fine match.

167
00:07:34,839 --> 00:07:35,920
After all she did for you,

168
00:07:36,680 --> 00:07:38,240
why did you kill her?

169
00:07:39,120 --> 00:07:40,040
Zhang Yuying.

170
00:07:41,639 --> 00:07:43,759
She was your own sister!

171
00:07:44,160 --> 00:07:45,160
Sister?

172
00:07:48,800 --> 00:07:50,399
Every time I hear that word,

173
00:07:50,879 --> 00:07:52,560
it makes me sick.

174
00:07:53,079 --> 00:07:54,079
She was legitimate.

175
00:07:54,680 --> 00:07:55,680
I was born to a concubine.

176
00:07:56,600 --> 00:07:58,560
We shared a father, nothing more.

177
00:07:59,160 --> 00:08:00,920
What sisterly bond could there be?

178
00:08:01,519 --> 00:08:02,680
All my life,

179
00:08:03,439 --> 00:08:04,560
I've been shackled

180
00:08:05,120 --> 00:08:07,879
to this bloodline I despise.

181
00:08:08,879 --> 00:08:09,959
I existed

182
00:08:11,519 --> 00:08:12,680
only to prove

183
00:08:14,000 --> 00:08:15,399
how perfect she was.

184
00:08:16,399 --> 00:08:17,399
Even...

185
00:08:18,360 --> 00:08:20,720
Even the man I loved looked my way

186
00:08:22,360 --> 00:08:24,360
only because I looked like her.

187
00:08:28,680 --> 00:08:29,480
Yes.

188
00:08:31,800 --> 00:08:33,399
Once she was dead,

189
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:36,160
Your Majesty...

190
00:08:37,959 --> 00:08:40,000
you could finally see me again.

191
00:08:41,240 --> 00:08:42,159
So...

192
00:08:43,600 --> 00:08:45,080
I killed her.

193
00:09:01,240 --> 00:09:05,427
♪Sunset fades beyond the lonely city♪

194
00:09:05,561 --> 00:09:09,174
♪Dusk snow paints the green hills♪

195
00:09:09,409 --> 00:09:12,008
♪A lone rider storms the old pass♪

196
00:09:12,045 --> 00:09:14,325
♪Drunk, I gaze by lamplight♪

197
00:09:14,372 --> 00:09:18,201
♪Old friends have all drifted away♪

198
00:09:18,603 --> 00:09:21,956
♪My broken sword rusts, as do I♪

199
00:09:22,883 --> 00:09:26,396
♪Jackdaws cry into the night♪

200
00:09:26,896 --> 00:09:29,463
♪Half a banner snaps in the wind♪

201
00:09:29,589 --> 00:09:31,622
♪In dreams, I return to the camps♪

202
00:09:31,689 --> 00:09:35,466
♪Moonlight chills my armor♪

203
00:09:35,816 --> 00:09:40,149
♪Life is a dream through many winters♪

204
00:09:40,372 --> 00:09:43,879
♪I gaze beyond the edge of the world♪

205
00:09:44,060 --> 00:09:46,913
♪Parting sorrow spills across the moon♪

206
00:09:46,980 --> 00:09:52,594
♪The moon and wind mean nothing now♪

207
00:09:52,634 --> 00:09:55,648
♪History turns to ash before ink dries♪

208
00:09:55,689 --> 00:10:01,697
♪Who plays the zither
and sighs at the pavilion?♪

209
00:10:02,364 --> 00:10:09,319
♪The past has faded away♪

210
00:10:09,319 --> 00:10:12,351
♪The past has faded away♪
